{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"161bc1b6-9702-4e45-a5d8-0e1f8a23d5b5":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486593077377__161bc1b6-9702-4e45-a5d8-0e1f8a23d5b5-1678206211dc006287-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"CM VIPER PREMIUM INDOOR\/OUTDOOR MATS"}},"template--14486593077377__161bc1b6-9702-4e45-a5d8-0e1f8a23d5b5-1678206211dc006287-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Made in house by the Canada Mats team, these mats offer the best value for your money. They also offer the fastest delivery dates, and the most flexibility for custom sizes.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593077377__161bc1b6-9702-4e45-a5d8-0e1f8a23d5b5-1678206211dc006287-0","template--14486593077377__161bc1b6-9702-4e45-a5d8-0e1f8a23d5b5-1678206211dc006287-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"609438b0-5404-47b1-b1c0-cdf10dec24ee":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/8950_720x_85583246-b8e8-4710-8560-c6ad273e59d2.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"Our Flagship Product","title":"CM VIPER 8950 MATS","text":"<p>Ideal for outdoor application, these mats feature mostly coarse scraper fibers but their close knit loop construction also hides water exceptionally, as moisture is hidden below the fibers until it is evaporated.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$9.50\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY CM VIPER 8950","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/cm-viper-8950-indoor-outdoor-scraper-matting","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"23d4fefd-0325-4067-a0ce-2893fead7399":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486593077377__23d4fefd-0325-4067-a0ce-2893fead7399-1678206284db50f2e2-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Dura_Nop_720x_391906b9-934e-49a9-a384-cecdaaed4d55.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"dura nop mats","text":"<p>The perfect blend of economy and quality, these long lasting mats come in a traditional Berber pattern. This omni-directional pattern is widely used across North America and traps 80% of dirt and moisture at the door.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$8.50\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"Buy dura nop","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/dura-nop-entrance-mats"}},"template--14486593077377__23d4fefd-0325-4067-a0ce-2893fead7399-1678206284db50f2e2-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/8900-1_1600x1600_862c9371-9bd1-455f-8831-64573736456a.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"CM VIPER 8150 MATS","text":"<p>The durable looped vinyl surface of this mat removes, hides, and traps dirt and moisture keeping surrounding areas clean and safe. The non-slip backing also allows water to quickly drain out of the side.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$6.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"Buy CM VIPER 8150","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/cm-viper-8150-everscrape-logo-mats"}},"template--14486593077377__23d4fefd-0325-4067-a0ce-2893fead7399-1678206284db50f2e2-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/dura-nop-entrance-mats-3_1200x1200_1_8aa3a7e8-724e-41b1-a791-c77409ca00cd.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"DURA NOP slimline mats","text":"<p>Dura Nop Slimline is suitable for all heavy traffic areas indoors as well as outdoors with an overhang. The heavy fiber and dense construction will prevent this mat from crushing<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$8.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"Buy Dura Nop slimline","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/dura-nop-slimline-entrance-mats"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593077377__23d4fefd-0325-4067-a0ce-2893fead7399-1678206284db50f2e2-0","template--14486593077377__23d4fefd-0325-4067-a0ce-2893fead7399-1678206284db50f2e2-1","template--14486593077377__23d4fefd-0325-4067-a0ce-2893fead7399-1678206284db50f2e2-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"2e38cff6-3f08-4a72-bd61-3bd3bd479268":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486593077377__2e38cff6-3f08-4a72-bd61-3bd3bd479268-1678206211dc006287-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"waterhog entrance mats"}},"template--14486593077377__2e38cff6-3f08-4a72-bd61-3bd3bd479268-1678206211dc006287-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Durable and stain-resistant mats with a unique bi-level design that traps dirt and moisture, keeping your floors clean, dry, and safe.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593077377__2e38cff6-3f08-4a72-bd61-3bd3bd479268-1678206211dc006287-0","template--14486593077377__2e38cff6-3f08-4a72-bd61-3bd3bd479268-1678206211dc006287-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486593077377__6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb-1678206284db50f2e2-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_35_23ef5931-de79-4106-a1c8-97eeaee97808.png","image_width":650,"title":"waterhog classic","text":"<p>WaterHog mats are durable, stain-resistant mats with a unique bi-level design that traps dirt and moisture, keeping your floors clean, dry, and safe.  The standard WaterHog mat features a classic waffle pattern.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$9.33\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy waterhog classic","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/waterhog-classic"}},"template--14486593077377__6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb-1678206284db50f2e2-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_36_ab6e46e9-63cd-4850-a230-81b3df2ee793.png","image_width":650,"title":"waterhog eco elite","text":"<p>Waterhog Eco Elite Entrance Mats as the name suggests is an eco-friendly and a certified green product. Using these mats especially for your new projects can assist in winning you valuable LEED certification points.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$13.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy waterhog eco elite","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/waterhog-eco-elite-mats"}},"template--14486593077377__6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb-1678206284db50f2e2-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_34_de725570-2379-4378-b3e1-3671532ba36e.png","image_width":650,"title":"waterhog tiles","text":"<p>WaterHog Tiles are designed to provide scalable flooring solutions for large areas. Bi-level surface effectively scrapes dirt and moisture from shoes, trapping it beneath shoe level to prevent tracking<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$11.85\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy waterhog tiles","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/waterhog-modular-tiles"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593077377__6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb-1678206284db50f2e2-0","template--14486593077377__6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb-1678206284db50f2e2-1","template--14486593077377__6f315087-60be-44ba-b8ec-6cfd57556fcb-1678206284db50f2e2-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"35795988-12e6-4b7e-887b-75e6bdb9cd55":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486593077377__35795988-12e6-4b7e-887b-75e6bdb9cd55-1678206211dc006287-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"All Indoor\/Outdoor Mats"}},"template--14486593077377__35795988-12e6-4b7e-887b-75e6bdb9cd55-1678206211dc006287-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Because of their versatility, wiper\/scraper mats are perfect to be used in standalone applications. <\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593077377__35795988-12e6-4b7e-887b-75e6bdb9cd55-1678206211dc006287-0","template--14486593077377__35795988-12e6-4b7e-887b-75e6bdb9cd55-1678206211dc006287-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"c